  "description": "Fighters of Record of Ragnarok for Teamfight Manager 2: Lu Bu, Thor, Zeus, Adam, Poseidon, Sasaki Kojiro, Heracles, Jack the Ripper. Kits are our own designs after the manga's fights: Lu Bu's Shield Breaker counts his blows double against shields and shatters them for real (the pack's own code, ragnarok.dll); Thor's Mjolnir flies out and back to his hand and awakens on every third skill; Zeus swells into his muscle body once he warms up and presses it down into Adamas for his ultimate; Adam reads every move with God Reader, dodges it and hits back with a copy, down to the Fist That Transcends Time; Poseidon needs no one - alone he hits harder and takes less (the pack's own code), and his trident floods a target for forty days and nights; Sasaki Kojiro, the greatest loser in history, learns every foe he strikes and hits them harder each time (the pack's own code), turns his blade back with Swallow Return and draws two swords for Niten Ganryu; Heracles, the god of justice who fights for humanity, spreads the brand of his Twelve Labors with every skill (the pack's own code) and makes his pact with Cerberus for his ultimate; Jack the Ripper sees the colour of every heart and strikes the frightened harder (the pack's own code), slips into the London fog under an umbrella his gloves made divine and throws a knife that Dear God made a divine weapon. Sharper frames from ragnarok.dll itself, with or without the League of Legends Heroes and Teamfight Tactics Heroes packs. Pixel art, effects, icons and sound effects made for this pack; Japanese voice lines from the official promotional recordings. Non-commercial fan project; Record of Ragnarok (c) its creators and publishers.",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-21",
  "mod_id": "ragnarok",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "Record of Ragnarok Heroes",
  "version": "0.6.0"
}
